{"version":1,"content":"<p>適逢秋冬轉季，乾燥天氣令不少人覺得雙眼乾澀、疲勞；</p><p>再加上手機不離手，眼部不適情況進一步惡化。</p><p>除了使用眼藥水，亦可從多方面入手改善。</p><p>請來註冊營養師教路，如何從日常飲食攝取6大護眼營養素，以及提醒生活注意事項，由內到外護理雙眼。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.176093+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.906964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.906964+00:00","content_hash":"46a556e5862db490c3f89582aed728f15f30515d20d44f402c633264956b349b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}